    "drum:laser": "Drum: laser",
    "help": "POCKET OPERATOR MOBILE v17.0 — SHORTCUTS\n\nPLAYBACK\nSpace: start/stop; Ctrl+R: record; Ctrl+E: drum editor.\nZ S X D C V G B H N J M , L . ; / and Q 2 W 3 E 4 R 5 T 6 Y 7 U: notes.\nF5–F12: Kick, Snare, HiHat, Tom, Clap, Cowbell, Crash, Laser.\nCtrl+F1–F5: Square, Saw, Triangle, Noise, DrumKit.\n\nKNOBS\nPgUp/PgDn: instrument A; Home/End: instrument B.\nCtrl+Alt+PgUp/PgDn/Home/End: layer knobs A/B.\nAlt+PgUp/PgDn/Home/End: effect knobs A/B.\nCtrl+PgUp/PgDn/Home/End: instrument extremes.\nDelete/Backspace: reset instrument A/B.\nCtrl+Alt+Delete/Backspace: reset layers; Alt+Delete/Backspace: reset FX.\n\nLAYERS AND EFFECTS\nAlt+` and Alt+1..= plus Alt+\\: toggle layer.\nCtrl+Shift+` and Ctrl+Shift+1..=: Punch-In while held.\nCtrl+Shift+Backspace: disable layers; Alt+Shift+Backspace: disable FX.\nCtrl+Num /,1..0,*,-,.: layer target; Ctrl+Shift+Num: FX target.\nCtrl+NumDel / Ctrl+Shift+NumDel: all layer/FX targets.\n\nOTHER\nAlt+Up/Down/Left: volume up/down/reset.\nCtrl+Up/Down/Left: octave up/down/reset.\nCtrl+S/G/H/B: Sustain/Glide/Chords/Block repeats.\nCtrl+Shift+P: global drums; Ctrl+Shift+Z X C V B N M ,: drums.\nCtrl+Shift+Escape: PANIC; Ctrl+Shift+Delete: factory reset.\nCtrl+O: open project; Ctrl+Shift+S: save; Ctrl+Shift+E: WAV.\nMIDI menu: mappings, MIDI Learn, controller profiles.\nSettings menu: language, theme, usage hints.\nCtrl+Alt+Shift+F9: MIDI change speech.\nCtrl+Alt+Shift+F10: computer keyboard change speech.\nPitch Bend: +/-2 semitones; center restores tuning. Mappings: clear Assignment enabled to disable an entry.\n\nAKM322: knobs 1/2 = instrument A/B; DATA = instrument selection; knob 3 = brightness filter; modulation wheel = vibrato. Live edits can be enabled in the mapping dialog.",
